  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indonesia: Regional Cooperation Arrangements (RCA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The regional Cooperation Arrangement (RCA) is a mechanism through which IOM supports the Government of Indonesia to assist refugees and asylum seekers in Indonesia with safe accommodation and basic assistance; health services; mental health and psychosocial services; formal and informal education and assisted voluntary return and reintegration. With the ongoing COVID-19 outbreak in Indonesia, IOM supports in ensuring access to COVID-19 prevention and mitigation measures for refugees and asylum seekers.</narrative>
  </description>
